     "onderschrift": "\\(f(x)=x\\) op \\([0,4]\\): ondersom \\(0+1+2+3=6\\) (links), bovensom \\(1+2+3+4=10\\) (rechts). De echte oppervlakte \\(8\\) ligt ertussen."
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Hoe meer deelintervallen, hoe beter de benadering. Als het aantal deelintervallen naar oneindig gaat, worden onder- en bovensom gelijk: de limiet van de ondersommen en bovensommen is de <strong>bepaalde integraal</strong> \\(\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,dx\\). Daarin is \\(f(x)\\) de <strong>integrand</strong> en komt \\(dx\\) overeen met \\(\\Delta x\\), de breedte van de rechthoekjes."
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<ul><li>Is \\(f(x)\\geq 0\\) op \\([a,b]\\), dan is \\(\\int_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,dx\\) de <strong>oppervlakte</strong> tussen de grafiek en de \\(x\\)-as.</li><li>Ligt de grafiek <strong>onder</strong> de \\(x\\)-as, dan is de integraal over dat stuk <strong>negatief</strong>.</li><li>\\(\\int_{a}^{a}f(x)\\,dx=0\\) en \\(\\int_{0}^{4}f\\,dx=\\int_{0}^{1}f\\,dx+\\int_{1}^{4}f\\,dx\\).</li><li>Bij een dalende functie is de ondersom nog altijd de kleinste: dan neem je de rechterkant.</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "Primitieve functies",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "\\(F\\) is een <strong>primitieve functie</strong> van \\(f\\) als \\(F^{\\prime}(x)=f(x)\\). Een functie heeft er oneindig veel: \\(x^{3}\\), \\(x^{3}+5\\) en \\(x^{3}-2\\) zijn allemaal primitieven van \\(3x^{2}\\). Je schrijft \\(\\int f(x)\\,dx=F(x)+c\\)."
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">\\(f(x)\\)</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">\\(\\int f(x)\\,dx\\)</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(k\\) (constante)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(kx+c\\), bv. \\(\\int 7\\,dx=7x+c\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{n}\\) (\\(n\\neq -1\\))</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+c\\), bv. \\(\\int x^{4}\\,dx=\\dfrac{x^{5}}{5}+c\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(k\\cdot f(x)\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(k\\int f(x)\\,dx\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(f(x)+g(x)\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\int f(x)\\,dx+\\int g(x)\\,dx\\) (een som, geen product)</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Voorbeeld: \\(\\int(6x^{2}-4x+3)\\,dx=2x^{3}-2x^{2}+3x+c\\)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "Bepaalde integralen berekenen",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<p style='text-align:center'><strong>\\(\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,dx=\\big[F(x)\\big]_{a}^{b}=F(b)-F(a)\\)</strong></p>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">integraal</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">berekening</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">resultaat</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\int_{0}^{3}x^{2}\\,dx\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\left[\\frac{x^{3}}{3}\\right]_{0}^{3}=9-0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(9\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\int_{1}^{2}(4x^{3}-2x)\\,dx\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\left[x^{4}-x^{2}\\right]_{1}^{2}=12-0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(12\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\int_{0}^{1}(3x^{2}+2x+1)\\,dx\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\left[x^{3}+x^{2}+x\\right]_{0}^{1}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(3\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\int_{1}^{3}x\\,dx\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\left[\\frac{x^{2}}{2}\\right]_{1}^{3}=\\frac{9}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(4\\) (niet \\(3-1\\))</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\int_{0}^{2}(x^{2}-4)\\,dx\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\frac{8}{3}-8\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(-\\frac{16}{3}\\): de grafiek ligt onder de as</td></tr></table>"
    }
